  "details": "- ACPICA: Fix use-after-free in acpi_ds_terminate_control_method() {CVE-2026-97455}\n- Bluetooth: HIDP: fix missing length checks in hidp_input_report() {CVE-2026-63947}\n- SUNRPC: make sure cache entry active before cache_show {CVE-2024-53174}\n- Bluetooth: bnep: fix incorrect length parsing in bnep_rx_frame() extension handling\n- ALSA: core: Fix potential UAF after asynchronous card release {CVE-2026-98266}\n- net: xfrm: reject unrepresentable espintcp transport headers {CVE-2026-98417}\n- ipv4: free inet_opt and ireq_opt after an RCU grace period {CVE-2026-98432}\n- KVM: x86: Use active memslots for the per-vCPU MMIO cache {CVE-2026-99082}\n- usb: typec: tcpm: Validate SVID index in svdm_consume_modes() {CVE-2026-64330}\n- net/sched: cls_api: remove block_cb from driver_list before freeing {CVE-2023-54193}\n- net: openvswitch: fix potential UAF on meter attach failure {CVE-2026-74465}\n- nvme-tcp: do not accept C2HData based on blk_rq_payload_bytes() alone {CVE-2026-89482}\n- bpf: Fix alu32 const subreg bound tracking on bitwise operations {CVE-2021-3490}\n- bpf: Fix signed_{sub,add32}_overflows type handling {CVE-2021-20268}",
